      "id": "claim_a35bd02c31f94790850cbf86a5e89925",
      "statement": "Warehouse creation and update in airbytehelpers accept only postgres/bigquery, save Airbyte config as a secret and store its id in OrgWarehouse.credentials, set bq_location for BigQuery, and on update resolve masked (starred) values from the current secret before updating the secret and the dbt profile block.",
